Package: librnnoise-ladspa
Version: 0.2-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: Jörg Schröder <projekt@lieraos.local>
Description: rnnoise noise suppression LADSPA plugin
 Real-time noise suppression LADSPA plugin built from the
 noise-suppression-for-voice project (werman). Provides the
 noise_suppressor_mono and noise_suppressor_stereo labels for
 PipeWire filter-chain usage (e.g. LieraAudio mic denoise).
Homepage: https://github.com/werman/noise-suppression-for-voice
